<view class="page"><view class="title">选择就诊人</view><view class="notice">为本人或获授权患者办理。代约仅适用于核验诊所的预约与候补。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="key" class="card"><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view>{{item.capacity}} · {{item.clinic}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.expiresLabel}}">有效至 {{item.expiresLabel}}（北京时间）</view><button class="primary" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy}}">为 {{item.name}} 办理</button></view><view wx:if="{{!busy && !rows.length}}" class="notice">暂无有效授权，请联系前台核对；手机号不会自动关联患者。</view><view class="muted">切换后原表单失效，已保存的预约保留。</view></view>